{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 6, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 6270117511271218203, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "hidden suite passed; test file untouched\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"ledger/__init__.py": {"bytes": 27, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "7ec6a9b0d10a936941a9134aff2540fcfb8dfda1bd57d58f46eab6bdb592fd2e"}, "ledger/currency.py": {"bytes": 588, "mtime": 1791849767.0863097, "sha256": "8182cfee8d467fd4e88808daa917f30788f62cb0b4bc6943e1975eab9acb10ce"}, "ledger/discounts.py": {"bytes": 154, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "ca6bc009ddec9b96e9dce613e450e2ca01e65f8ed5a309f383e21e354bb7ec36"}, "ledger/lines.py": {"bytes": 250, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "af67d4282c6d6a1644f025eceb4df16f828ad9d3a39faea5ed956ee655ff1683"}, "ledger/report.py": {"bytes": 252, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "9f260adb70c8bc21fd7f8a7386b8ff6782441f59c3e94e062da2a1aa15609b2e"}, "ledger/tax.py": {"bytes": 144, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "5101c17e6545aa9ad336a4f39ee1de235ce8aea6fbecdf69d7b720ac302ea97e"}, "ledger/totals.py": {"bytes": 292, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "d43041148eb2c535c8dccdb09cf8be5c430f21dab713e6011da0a34036ffa541"}, "tests/test_report.py": {"bytes": 144, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "9c00269575abb1361ebb609c04e6f8304bbb7034ade261d196e5174d16116e46"}, "tests/test_totals.py": {"bytes": 443, "mtime": 1791848279.183353, "sha256": "b33548e48cc53a932d7b6ef1355d7ed4c9b018e02cf492672becf8853777a1c3"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/pi-check/cache2/bin/omp/20663d0e0d0452dc3e41b38370e1e8f6e7036579/omp", "-p", "`tests/test_totals.py` is failing. Fix the bug.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cap30-16/omp-16/transcripts/with/trig-omp-multistep/21/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 2, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "11.9.0 (/workspace/pi-check/cache2/bin/omp/20663d0e0d0452dc3e41b38370e1e8f6e7036579/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Shell is mangling indentation; use a script file.\nFixed. All 4 tests in `tests/test_totals.py` now pass, and so does `tests/test_report.py`. pytest isn't installed here, so I ran the test functions directly with a small script.\n\n**Cause:** `to_cents` in `ledger/currency.py` used `int(amount * 100)`. Many prices can't be stored exactly as floats, and `int()` cuts off the fraction instead of rounding:\n- `19.99 * 100` = `1998.9999\u2026`, which became `1998`\n- `0.29 * 100` = `28.999\u2026`, which became `28`\n- `4.35 * 100` = `434.99\u2026`, which became `434`\n\nEach of these lost a cent, and the error carried through into the subtotal, tax and discount results.\n\n**Fix:** `to_cents` now converts the amount to a `Decimal` via `str()` and rounds half-up to whole cents:\n\n```python\nreturn int((Decimal(str(amount)) * 100).quantize(Decimal(1), rounding=ROUND_HALF_UP))\n```\n\nGoing through `str()` means `19.99` is treated as exactly `19.99`, not its float approximation. Spot checks: `19.99\u21921999`, `0.29\u219229`, `4.35\u2192435`, `-0.29\u2192-29`, `0.1+0.2\u219230`, `10\u21921000`, `\"2.50\"\u2192250`.\n\n**Behaviour changes:**\n- Amounts with more than two decimal places are now rounded half-up instead of cut off (`1.005\u2192101`, `1234.565\u2192123457`). If your business rule needs different rounding for those, change `rounding=` here.\n- `to_cents` now accepts strings like `\"2.50\"`, which it didn't before.\n\nThe root problem is that prices are stored as floats in `Line.unit_price`. Passing `Decimal` or string prices from the start would remove this whole class of error, but I didn't change that because it goes beyond this fix.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 0, "replies_ok": 8, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 155918, "requests_cache_write": 91674, "requests_cost_usd": 0.5383256000000001, "requests_count": 8, "requests_input_uncached": 18, "requests_output": 2435, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-multistep:claude-opus-5-5:trial21", "run_seed": 20261014, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 41, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-13T00:02:32.420036+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 30.036, "t_checker_s": 0.386, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-multistep", "task_calls": 0, "timeout_s": 360, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 2453, "tokens_cache_read": 155918, "tokens_cache_write": 91674, "tokens_fresh": 2453, "tokens_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_main_cache_read": 155918, "tokens_main_cache_write": 91674, "tokens_main_calls": 8, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_main_output": 2435, "tokens_output": 2435, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 155918, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 91674, "tokens_proxy_calls": 8, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_proxy_output": 2435, "tokens_proxy_reasoning": null, "tokens_reasoning": 0, "trial": 21, "ts_iso": "2026-10-12T17:02:33", "turn_mode": null, "turns": 8, "usage_raw": [{"cacheRead": 15748, "cacheWrite": 13765, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output": 0, "total": 0}, "input": 4, "output": 94, "totalToken